        "created_at": "2019-10-08T17:25:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I liked the part where the Patreon listeners were revealed to be somehow abnormal. :V</p>\n<p>No, but seriously, that final twist Christopher came up with,&nbsp;it's like... PTSD, Stockholm Syndrome, and the fact that they were all <em>aware</em> of everything that had been happening since the hive mind took over. Wow. I'll never look at Orrim Hiveminded the same way.</p>",
