      {
        "id": 264334,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:25:36.139Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Retconning the Voss Disparation, I strongly disagree with their off the cuff decision to use Apostate in place of Ambuscade.  He’s not even properly human, and he’s an arch-villain, not just a troublemaker like Ansel.  It should have been someone more along the lines of, like, well okay characters that premiere before the 80s really limits it so I can’t actually come up with anything that I’m sure works, but someone along the lines of Char or Arsonator.</p>\n<p>Ah, the return of the ATM Machine joke.  The version of that from the Benchmark episode, which Justifier said was one of his favorite bits,  I can now definitely confirm is THE single favorite bit of the whole podcast up to this point for me.</p>\n<p>Pretty sure this was the first episode ever where C&amp;A read a letter and then  flatly refused to answer it at the time.  And then they did it twice in a row!</p>\n<p>They’re discussing covers!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rofl.png?v=12\" title=\":rofl:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rofl:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rofl.png?v=12\" title=\":rofl:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rofl:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rofl.png?v=12\" title=\":rofl:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rofl:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">  That joke was great and I completely forgot about it.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2025-10-30T16:39:18.879Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
